- **Audio Playback in Polling Loop**: 
  - In the `fetchStatus()` polling loop, update the `current_sentence` UI.
  - Check if `data.audio_url` has changed since the last poll.
  - If a new URL is detected (and it is not empty):
    ```javascript
    if (data.audio_url && data.audio_url !== currentAudioUrl) {
        currentAudioUrl = data.audio_url;
        const player = document.getElementById('tts_player');
        player.src = currentAudioUrl;
        player.play().catch(e => console.error("Auto-play blocked:", e));
